  "voice": "Views",
  "speed": 0.9,
  "clips": [
    {
      "index": 0,
      "text": "Love.",
      "path": "audio/1971-195/01.mp3",
      "start": 0.0,
      "end": 0.531723
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "text": "Don't think about surrender at all because that which thinks about it is the only barrier.",
      "path": "audio/1971-195/02.mp3",
      "start": 1.710295,
      "end": 6.2640590000000005
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "text": "And therefore no one can surrender; it is not a doing at all, it happens.",
      "path": "audio/1971-195/03.mp3",
      "start": 7.4570289999999995,
      "end": 13.344036
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "text": "You cannot go to it, it comes to you.",
      "path": "audio/1971-195/04.mp3",
      "start": 14.510363,
      "end": 16.918073
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "text": "And any effort on your part will hinder its coming.",
      "path": "audio/1971-195/05.mp3",
      "start": 18.080634999999997,
      "end": 20.729138000000003
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "text": "Be open and effortless, relaxed and passive, and it will come - it always comes.",
      "path": "audio/1971-195/06.mp3",
      "start": 22.224558,
      "end": 28.394354
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "text": "I am a witness of it.",
      "path": "audio/1971-195/07.mp3",
      "start": 29.866757,
      "end": 31.35
    }
  ]
}
